text.paragraph:
Renal: Renal failure, renal dysfunction, interstitial nephritis (see 

   WARNINGS
).

The usual initial dose in adults is 25 mg daily given as a single dose. The dose may be increased to 50 mg daily, given as a single or two divided doses. Doses above 50 mg are often associated with marked reductions in serum potassium (see also 

                                    PRECAUTIONS
                                 ).
